  "note": "Each vector drives a client's coverage state through `ops` and compares the topics reported at every `open`. `initialCursor` is the §5 cursor the client was constructed with, or null. Ops: [\"sync\", topics] — the client is about to open for this set; [\"open\", topics] — the stream for this set is open, and the vector's next expected entry is what it must report; [\"advance\", id] — a data frame the client accepted moved the cursor.",
